      "headline": "7 Mistakes That Delay a BISP Online Registration (And How to Fix Them)",
      "description": "Avoid the 7 critical mistakes that delay or reject BISP registration. Learn the truth about online forms, the NSER dynamic process, and 8171 CNIC checks.",
